# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，消除 Windows CRLF 噪音（见 docs/06-代码规范 §2）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行符处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.doc binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
